      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIZZY'S GIRL (3) got around the 461m at Hobart to take a Grade 5 in a strong 25.98 for a neck victory. Smart win latest and looks a key chance again here. GREEDY BUTCHER (1) is mixing form lately, finishing out of the placings last time at Hobart but was a Grade 5 winner two back at Hobart. Can feature with the right run. BLACKBRUSH ROSE (5) is still a maiden after 27 runs but rarely far away, the latest finishing out of the placings when fifth at Hobart. Returns to a favourable course. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. BLACKBRUSH BILL (2) should be thereabouts.",
